<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Doctor Application Update</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f7f7f7; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 500px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
        .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Application Status Update</h2>
        <p>Dear Dr. <%= name %>,</p>
        <p>We regret to inform you that your application to join PH Healthcare System as a doctor has been reviewed and rejected.</p>
        <% if (locals.rejectionReason) { %>
            <p><strong>Reason for rejection:</strong> <%= rejectionReason %></p>
        <% } %>
        <p>If you believe this decision was made in error or if you have any questions, please contact our support team.</p>
        <div class="footer">&copy; PH Healthcare System. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
